    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca in Arapiraca is the name of the ground of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense. Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense (full name \"Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense\") play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league from Brazil."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The Arapiraca based Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca is the training ground of Agremiacao Sportiva Arapiraquense. With a full name of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, this team play in the Brazilian based Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league."
